---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { releaseManifestSchema } from "@lensflow/contracts";
import releaseFeed from "../../public/latest.json";
const manifest = releaseManifestSchema.parse(releaseFeed);
const published = manifest.status === "published";
const releaseDate = published ? new Intl.DateTimeFormat("zh-CN", { dateStyle: "long", timeZone: "Asia/Shanghai" }).format(new Date(manifest.publishedAt)) : "尚未发布";
---
<SiteLayout title="下载｜镜序 Lensflow" description="下载 Lensflow Chrome 扩展并查看手动安装和升级说明">
  <main><section class="page-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">DOWNLOAD</span><h1>安装到桌面 Chrome</h1><p>首版通过 GitHub Release 提供可审查 ZIP。Chrome Web Store 地址在真实发布前不会显示。</p></div></section>
  <section class="content-band"><div class="release-panel"><div><span class="eyebrow">{published ? "LATEST STABLE" : "UNRELEASED"}</span><h2>{published ? `v${manifest.version}` : "尚无稳定版"}</h2><p class="release-status">{published ? "该版本已经由标签工作流构建并发布。" : `计划版本 v${manifest.plannedVersion} 尚未创建 Release，当前不提供虚构下载。`}</p><div class="release-meta"><div><span>发布时间</span><strong>{releaseDate}</strong></div><div><span>最低 Chrome</span><strong>{manifest.minimumChrome}</strong></div><div><span>桥接协议</span><strong>v{manifest.bridgeProtocol}</strong></div><div><span>SHA-256</span><strong class="release-hash">{published ? manifest.sha256 : "发布后生成"}</strong></div></div>{published ? <a class="button primary" href={manifest.downloadUrl}>下载扩展 ZIP</a> : <a class="button" href="https://github.com/AJ-nb/lensflow/releases">查看 GitHub Release</a>}{published && <a class="release-notes-link" href={manifest.notesUrl}>查看更新说明</a>}</div><div class="prose"><h2>ZIP 手动安装</h2><ol><li>下载 ZIP 并校验 Release 页面中的 SHA-256。</li><li>解压到固定目录，不要直接从压缩包运行。</li><li>打开 <code>chrome://extensions</code>，启用开发者模式。</li><li>选择“加载已解压的扩展程序”，指向包含 manifest.json 的目录。</li><li>升级前先导出备份，再覆盖原目录并点击重新加载。</li></ol><p class="notice">不同扩展 ID 无法直接共享 IndexedDB。迁移时使用旧插件导出、新插件导入；API Key 永不导入。</p></div></div></section></main>
</SiteLayout>
